# The journal opening, two steps of a quest and the "quest complete" celebration.
Output docs/images/hero.gif
Set Height 760
Source docs/demo/settings.tape

Hide
Type "/tmp/qt-seed /tmp/qt-vhs full >/dev/null; clear; ./quest" Enter
Sleep 700ms
Show

Sleep 4s
Space
Sleep 2.4s
Space
Sleep 3.4s
Down
Sleep 700ms
Down
Sleep 1.2s
